The streaming phase-vocoder pitch shifter in Source/dsp/PitchShifter.cpp is
adapted from PitchLab / MegaTune, Copyright (c) 2026 PitchLab, under the MIT
licence. Its MIT notice is retained in that file and a copy of the licence is
in LICENSES/PitchLab-MIT.txt.

No RNNoise build, model weights, third-party fonts, or recorded audio are
bundled. The test and demo signals are generated numerically; the UI uses the
system Helvetica Neue font. pluginval is a validation tool and is not included
in the distributed plugin package.
